meta {
  name: LIST
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/pestisida?page=1&per_page=25
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  per_page: 25
  q: ~
  komoditas: ~
  jenis_sasaran: ~
  type: ~
  target_type: ~
  merek_id: ~
  sort: akhir_izin_desc
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Admin (auth-only) paginated list of raw `pestisida_snapshots` rows. Each row is one (merek × komoditas × sasaran × organisme) combination — so a single brand can appear in many rows. Use this in the admin table to inspect what got scraped.

  **Query params:**
  - `page` (int, default 1)
  - `per_page` (int, default 25, max 100)
  - `q` (string) — matches merek / bahan aktif / no. pendaftaran / pemegang. **Case-insensitive** (since 2026-05-27)
  - `komoditas` — substring match, **case-insensitive**, **multi-value** (since 2026-05-27). Accepts single, comma-separated (`?komoditas=cabai,padi`), or array (`?komoditas[]=cabai&komoditas[]=padi`). OR within column.
  - `jenis_sasaran` — substring match, **case-insensitive**, **multi-value** (same formats + OR semantics as `komoditas`)
  - `type` (enum, **multi-value**, since 2026-05-27) — derived from `jenis_pestisida` prefix. Accepts single, comma-separated, or array. Valid: `insektisida`, `fungisida`, `herbisida`, `akarisida`, `rodentisida`, `nematisida`, `moluskisida`, `bakterisida`, `zpt`, `pupuk`, `lainnya`. Unknown values are silently ignored (admin permissively filtered, mobile returns 422).
  - `target_type` (enum, **multi-value**, since 2026-05-27) — petani-facing rollup: `hama` (insektisida+akarisida+rodentisida+nematisida+moluskisida) / `penyakit` (fungisida+bakterisida) / `gulma` (herbisida) / `zat_pengatur` (zpt+pupuk) / `lainnya`. Same formats; unknown values silently ignored.
  - When `komoditas`, `jenis_sasaran`, `type`, and `target_type` are sent together they're AND'd across columns.
  - `merek_id` (int) — exact match for a single brand
  - `sort` (enum, default `akhir_izin_desc`) — one of `akhir_izin_desc`, `akhir_izin_asc`, `nama_asc`, `nama_desc`

  **Response field `type` (since 2026-05-27):** every row in `data[]` includes a derived `type` field alongside the verbose `jenis_pestisida`.
}

example {
  name: List: First page

  request: {
    url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/pestisida?page=1&per_page=25
    method: GET
    mode: none
    headers: {
      Accept: application/json
      Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
    }
  }

  response: {
    headers: {
      content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
    }

    status: {
      code: 200
      text: OK
    }

    body: {
      type: json
      content: '''
        {
          "success": true,
          "message": "Pestisida rows",
          "data": {
            "current_page": 1,
            "per_page": 25,
            "total": 20008,
            "last_page": 801,
            "data": [
              {
                "id": 1,
                "snapshot_date": "2026-05-26",
                "merek_id": 98,
                "merek_pestisida": "AGAFENA 230 EC",
                "bahan_aktif": "abamektin (abamectin): 30 g/l klorfenapir (chlorfenapyr): 200 g/l",
                "jenis_pestisida": "Insektisida racun kontak dan lambung berbentuk pekatan yang dapat diemulsikan",
                "type": "insektisida",
                "komoditas": "Cabai",
                "jenis_sasaran": "hama trips",
                "organisme": "Thrips parvispinus",
                "cara_aplikasi_dosis": "Penyemprotan volume tinggi: 0,75 ml/l",
                "tanggal_akhir_izin": "20 Januari 2031",
                "pemegang_pendaftaran": "PT Agro Guna Makmur",
                "nomor_pendaftaran": "RI. 01010120155286",
                "fetched_at": "2026-05-26T13:14:29+07:00"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      '''
    }
  }
}
